    <item>
      <title>Harborline Coffee Roasters</title>
      <link>https://harborline.example.com/</link>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[mara]]></dc:creator>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[
<div class="elementor elementor-8 elementor-section-boxed" data-elementor-type="wp-page">
  <p>We roast on the north quay every Tuesday and Friday, in batches small enough that one person can taste the whole day's output before it ships.</p>
  <p>Bags leave the roastery within eighteen hours. Nothing sits in a warehouse waiting for a truck to fill up.</p>
  <h2>What we are good at</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Single-origin lots bought on repeat contracts, not spot</li>
    <li>Wholesale accounts that get the same lot for a whole season</li>
    <li>Roast profiles published with every bag</li>
  </ul>
  <p><a href="https://harborline.example.com/wholesale/">Wholesale enquiries</a> are answered inside two working days.</p>
</div>
<script src="https://harborline.example.com/wp-includes/js/wp-emoji-release.min.js" defer></script>
