    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>https://harborline.example.com/about/</link>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[mara]]></dc:creator>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p>Harborline started in 2016 with one 5kg roaster and a market stall. Nine years later the stall is gone and the roaster is bigger, but the batch size is deliberately still small.</p>
<h2>How we buy</h2>
<p>We buy on repeat contracts with four producers. If a lot is good we take it again the following season rather than chasing a new one for the label.</p>
<p>Our roastery is open to visitors — see <a href="/about/our-roastery/">the roastery</a>.</p>
      ]]></content:encoded>
      <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[One roaster, four producers, repeat contracts.]]></excerpt:encoded>
