    <item>
      <title>Dialing in a filter batch in four cups</title>
      <link>https://harborline.example.com/dialing-in-four-cups/</link>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[tobias]]></dc:creator>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p>Four cups is enough. Grind coarse, grind fine, and two in between; taste them side by side while they are still warm.</p>
<ol>
  <li>Fix the dose and the water. Change one variable.</li>
  <li>Brew all four before tasting any.</li>
  <li>Pick the one you would drink a second cup of, not the one that scores best.</li>
</ol>
      ]]></content:encoded>
      <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Grind coarse, grind fine, two in between.]]></excerpt:encoded>
